[SIZE=6][B][COLOR=#FF6600]🎃 Halloween Plugin v3.1.1 - Bug Fix Release 🎃[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=4][B]Bug Fix: Pumpkin Surprise Configuration Now Works![/B][/SIZE]

In v3.1.0, we added config options to control the pumpkin surprise easter egg, but the code wasn't actually reading them. This has been fixed!

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]🐛 What Was Fixed[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[B]The Problem:[/B]
Config options [FONT=courier new]enable_pumpkin_surprise[/FONT] and [FONT=courier new]pumpkin_surprise_count[/FONT] existed in v3.1.0 but were [B]completely ignored[/B] by the plugin. The code still used hardcoded values.

[B]The Fix:[/B]
Code now properly reads and respects both configuration options!

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]✨ What You Can Do Now[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=4][B]1. Disable the Pumpkin Surprise Feature[/B][/SIZE]

Don't want player inventories filling with pumpkins? Just disable it:

[CODE]events:
  pumpkin:
    enable_pumpkin_surprise: false  # No more inventory flooding!
[/CODE]

[SIZE=4][B]2. Customize the Trigger Count[/B][/SIZE]

Want it to trigger after 5 pumpkins instead of 3?

[CODE]events:
  pumpkin:
    pumpkin_surprise_count: 5  # Requires 5 pumpkins before surprise
[/CODE]

[SIZE=4][B]3. Make It Trigger Immediately[/B][/SIZE]

Want every pumpkin to fill the inventory? (Chaos mode!)

[CODE]events:
  pumpkin:
    pumpkin_surprise_count: 1  # Surprise on EVERY pumpkin!
[/CODE]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]📝 Configuration[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

The config options that [B]now actually work[/B]:

[CODE]events:
  # Pumpkin Curse - Places carved pumpkin on player's head
  pumpkin:
    enabled: true
    min: 5
    max: 20
    enable_pumpkin_surprise: true  # ← NOW WORKS! Enable/disable inventory fill
    pumpkin_surprise_count: 3      # ← NOW WORKS! Customize trigger count
[/CODE]

[B]Default Values:[/B]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=courier new]enable_pumpkin_surprise: true[/FONT] - Feature is enabled by default
[*][FONT=courier new]pumpkin_surprise_count: 3[/FONT] - Triggers on 3rd pumpkin (same as before)
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

