[LIST]
[*]No manual config changes needed
[*]Existing configs work perfectly
[*]Default behavior is identical to v3.1.0
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B]From v3.0.x to v3.1.1:[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*]Smart merge automatically adds new config keys
[*]Your customizations are preserved
