[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]🔧 Technical Details[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[B]What Changed:[/B]

[SIZE=3][B]Before (v3.1.0) - Hardcoded:[/B][/SIZE]
[CODE]if (count == 3 && !data.hasPumpkinPrank(player.getUniqueId())) {
    fillFreeSlotsWithPumpkins(player);  // Always at 3, can't disable
}
[/CODE]

[SIZE=3][B]After (v3.1.1) - Config-Driven:[/B][/SIZE]
[CODE]boolean surpriseEnabled = getConfig().getBoolean("events.pumpkin.enable_pumpkin_surprise", true);
int surpriseCount = Math.max(1, getConfig().getInt("events.pumpkin.pumpkin_surprise_count", 3));

if (surpriseEnabled && count >= surpriseCount && !data.hasPumpkinPrank(player.getUniqueId())) {
    fillFreeSlotsWithPumpkins(player);  // Now respects your config!
}
[/CODE]

[B]Build Info:[/B]
[LIST]
[*]JAR Size: 133,725 bytes (~131 KB)
[*]Java: 17+
[*]Spigot/Paper: 1.20-1.21.1
[*]Build Status: ✅ Clean (zero errors)
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]📚 What's the Pumpkin Surprise?[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

When a player receives their 3rd pumpkin (from events or login), the plugin fills all empty inventory slots with stacks of 64 carved pumpkins as a fun easter egg! 🎃

[B]Now you can:[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Disable it entirely if you don't want it
[*]Change when it triggers (1st pumpkin, 5th pumpkin, 10th, etc.)
[*]Keep the default behavior (3rd pumpkin)
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

